   106	** be "40f-21a-20c".  The "40f-" indicates the 4-digit year followed by "-".
   107	** The "21a-" indicates the 2-digit month followed by "-".  The "20c" indicates
   108	** the 2-digit day which is the last integer in the set.
   109	**
